{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "30c18c59d2eae768d1d9e00dda8035ce100a8080a41f43adec14d9d83c27658c", "ja": "たたかうせなか", "zh": "战斗的背影", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b62b095a9aca60a2c756885cf946e2243ab1b0c68eefe867556ff2f5b25488f0", "ja": "通し稽古が終わり、それぞれ手応えを感じる\nメンバー。しかし本番直前、桃子の姿が\n見当たらない。探しにきたまつりに、桃子は\n「演技だけは誰にも負けたくない」のだと\n胸の内を明かし、まつりはそれを了解する。", "zh": "通排结束后，成员们都感受到了成果。然而就在正式演出前，桃子却不见了踪影。前来寻找她的茉莉，听桃子吐露了“只有演技，我不想输给任何人”的心声，也理解了她的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b88daa1442ff9edfb4fafbf0654e8c55bca221e7a5a404aafc784fc614b97bfc", "ja": "（初めての通し稽古が終わった。\nしかし、これは……）", "zh": "（第一次合排结束了。不过，这……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "98a28437247fdd6ba54343fd25db229edd1bb86c346bc6c6d1b46510c17bd37f", "ja": "みんなーっ！\nすっ……ごく、よかったよーっ！", "zh": "大家——！\n超……级棒哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "253247adbb23f1071edac4bc8e37aff3bb4d657fd48581b6d18785511e65cff8", "ja": "海美ちゃん……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "c4c3188edfd5c617c842f345c18795de4ed667369313e6f980b7fde698835bcc", "ja": "なんで私の役、死んじゃってるんだろう！？\nううっ、私もここにいたかった～っ！", "zh": "为什么我的角色已经死了啊！？\n呜呜，我也好想待在这里啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "767de78fdd9b44fb88e4f74ab5b57b1fb4a568d36fb177a6c9a52c99497394ff", "ja": "海美さんてば……お姉ちゃんが生きてたら、\nドラマにならないでしょ。", "zh": "海美姐真是的……要是姐姐还活着，\n那就演不成电视剧了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "b690fddfa2ad7361c45052a481ee47750182aebd5d964d5d0b65a7e23e1152d7", "ja": "あっ、そっか！\nえへへ♪", "zh": "啊，原来如此！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eaa31fd43f044a27737a967ddef4bcab097d273a386a4c9b0906e734a33c64c8", "ja": "ふふっ。……掛け合いも上手くいってたし、\n最初にしては、けっこうよかったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "呵呵……配合得也很顺利，\n作为第一次来说，应该已经相当不错了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "fa91565c51a6961585ecdaa6673f231453987600789319c93e86a616d6f30768", "ja": "はいなのです！　……みんなそれぞれ輝いていて、\nとても素敵なお芝居だったと、姫は思うのです。", "zh": "是的！……大家都各自闪耀着光芒，\n姬觉得这是场非常精彩的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "0f622c4ff1533b8a74f97b41007c0bf1a8e264dfe899b4d923ec8bc208aaa033", "ja": "うんうん！　本当にすごかったっ！\nこの調子で、本番もがんばろうねっ☆", "zh": "嗯嗯！真的太厉害了！\n就照这个状态继续努力，正式演出也要加油哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "68aefe6dfed1c84ba2cfcac9ba505dc0364e7fa52f8816989886d053f4211a31", "ja": "（本当に、まるで舞台を観ているみたいだった。\nこれは今から、本番が楽しみだな……）", "zh": "（真的，就像是在看舞台剧一样。\n真让人期待接下来的正式演出了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1015_null", "source_sha256": "56fde8424150d320d2a41ee2bc7d575db88ebd4183eba8510c59214f87ac10b1", "ja": "2週間後、公演初日……", "zh": "2周后，演出首日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "37246929fbd03e82d1ce409a3d2695bcd520c8d5965e51bae25299e8678d5959", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』、間もなく初日が始まる。\nけど、桃子の姿が見当たらない……）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》的首日公演马上就要开始了。可是，却找不到桃子的身影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "d0e0133167f6a27830b3e73b82f9ff840ffbe5bbd71e895dfbd18b7ab0bb2736", "ja": "あれ～？　もうすぐ始まるのに、\nももちん、どこ行ったんだろう？", "zh": "咦～？马上就要开始了，\n小桃子跑去哪儿了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7e63e32d0df6284755a3950db4e7323a378459e3448d47768af7909a388a65ec", "ja": "まつりちゃんもいないみたい。\n桃子ちゃんと一緒なのかな……？", "zh": "看来小桃也不在。是和桃子在一起吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0212150e29da5eaaf8111d8698b297738404fb5f77f9756ded9b6d1f83bb658b", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。ちょっと探してくるよ。", "zh": "也许吧。我去找找看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c901ea11aa2c299f2c3a58460faa4c51f7f5463ab3600b6ec5ed65ae9a15b32e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、\nそれなら私も一緒に……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，那我也一起去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "15a9955e82f27e0a1b375ebc3c5835d3d452e903f95aff09a73aa3c5a664a0d8", "ja": "私も行く！", "zh": "我也要去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "be28bd81efb1579b7375ca1ee6900620b32a4c0e4a73b6062058fe5f49860c19", "ja": "あのね、お姉ちゃん。私、お医者さんになりたいんだ。\nお医者さんになって、お母さんの病気を治したい……。", "zh": "那个，大姐姐。我想当医生。\n当上医生后，我想治好妈妈的病……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "4b423b4db06924c8c3e59c233b4b1141b153ca55f382037e36bf56e0de492890", "ja": "……桃子ちゃん、\nこんなところにいたのです。", "zh": "……桃子，\n原来你在这里呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb02517b2758cdfd8ec7569e55dfe8330e3e34ba81aab4d29ef04f339c701738", "ja": "！\nまつりさん……。", "zh": "！\n茉莉姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "8d49b872ede69411b9b2dedcda762e0e3681974c4d782cef25ee4ad8d9342c1a", "ja": "今日の桃子ちゃん、ずっと、こわーい顔を\nしているのです。……緊張しているのです？", "zh": "今天的桃子，一直都是一副好可怕的表情\n呢。……是因为紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "cab1a13e6eb30be7b107b4dbf00e4de140841cacd823dd55c0eda30e24edda2a", "ja": "別に、緊張なんて……。", "zh": "才没有，紧张什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "864608ea3b63eb773752b40c3151211a6627bb2ffbfa8270b2fe8bfbbbe4185c", "ja": "……ううん。\nやっぱり、してるのかも。緊張……。", "zh": "……不。\n我可能，还是在紧张吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "564118ce827910f54068e7de021205831d2d186c9fb522d0f32a9044bb46e74f", "ja": "まつりさん。桃子ね、今まで劇場のみんなに……\nううん。劇場のみんなだけじゃなくて。", "zh": "茉莉小姐。桃子啊，至今为止对剧场的大家……\n不对。不仅是对剧场的大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "cc80504ea48f3ac356b218430907af0313c483a9a93de3f195c47338fc49f95a", "ja": "お芝居では、誰にも\n負けないようにしなきゃって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "在演戏方面，我一直觉得自己不能输给任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "2368c987d71e37bfaad5cc9635791048d87296482d9b070b7055982c6f03462f", "ja": "でも、今回は……もしかしたら、\n負けちゃうかもしれないって……。だから……。", "zh": "可是，这次……也许会输……我这么想着……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "1dca1653a086f35386b70997c4db1d2297b3a084c3f6697d0606ba63ccafc276", "ja": "……桃子ちゃんは、\n負けたくないと思ったのですね？", "zh": "……桃子是不想输，\n才会有这种想法的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "b26df8f42028464ce08ffd8ce3e284de2eebeba47e2e2bd4c53a957d50cdbe4c", "ja": "それなら、怖い顔でもOKなのです。\nだってそれは、桃子ちゃんが努力している証拠だから。", "zh": "那样的话，就算是一副可怕的表情也没关系哦。因为那正是桃子在努力的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4b11320b2b379420bd72ffd4d26eb365de0762c13c0ca2dfb1e7d053849716d", "ja": "だから、こわーい顔をしていても、\n姫は応援するのですよ。", "zh": "所以，就算摆出一副可怕的表情，\n公主也会为你加油的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "8f43b3b28caf84a882a1c53183c914893d2213e160a3695055e1991bcbcf8df0", "ja": "まつりさん……。\nありがと。", "zh": "小松莉……  \n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "292d286aaaafa05396090f0fd7c126bb8b9c8b809fbd890bc5fea95fea54a265", "ja": "ねえ、まつりさん。\n桃子は勝てるかな。今日だけじゃなくて、これからも。", "zh": "呐，茉莉。  \n桃子能赢吗？不只是今天，以后也能一直赢下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "7606d02098d2ce6226c279498c7387409df221e43c7898ea5d969cc9c0db2c9b", "ja": "勝つというのが、どういうことなのかにも\nよるのですけど……。", "zh": "这也要看，所谓获胜究竟是指什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "55f5414ae71e516a8af0dec617bb40cb5f119b6c158d0fe5bdad6939d8e96a30", "ja": "でも、勝負はやってみなくちゃわからない！\n……と、姫は思うのですよ？", "zh": "不过，胜负不试试看是不会知道结果的！\n……公主是这么想的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "51c48e8341766c1aa310245c890ab68dfdd5a1ad037546b0205b52d54ee5979e", "ja": "！\n……うん！　そうだよね！", "zh": "！\n……嗯！就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "925b38725ac0e19d85e72dfa8dbf46b2d27dd1f8af1439ded862391d76afba1e", "ja": "……。\nももちん……。", "zh": "……。\n桃酱……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7dc7ef16668f2eacaa8a62ecdfd3a9ad654084a04ca6821880a29f0ca2646a88", "ja": "まつりちゃんが見つけてくれて、よかったですね。\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "幸好是小松莉发现了你。\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a7d18feffc968b065d68d12ef30f3a762e8cad05bc2781d1a9577c2c4e0b0d36", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n……先に戻っていようか。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n……我们先回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_06_1046_p", "source_sha256": "93c86218c49406fa8205a497f785c704c3d50e44abd823cb169b6b1ab975e879", "ja": "（桃子の負けたくないという気持ちは、\n全員の頑張る背中を、きっと強く押している……）", "zh": "（桃子不想输的这份心情，一定会更加推动大家努力向前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
